  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:202px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Countess_crypt_mistress.jpg\" title=\"Countess Crypt Mistress\"><img alt=\"Countess Crypt Mistress\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"292\" src=\"/images/Countess_crypt_mistress.jpg\" width=\"200\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Countess_crypt_mistress.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Countess Crypt Mistress</div></div></div>\n<p>Countess Crypt Mistress is found in <a href=\"/wiki/Balzack's_Burrow\" title=\"Balzack's Burrow\">The Nether Crypts</a> off of <a href=\"/wiki/Balzack's_Burrow\" title=\"Balzack's Burrow\">Balzack's Burrow</a> Level 5.  She is the object of the quest <a href=\"/wiki/Lovely_Little_Bumps\" title=\"Lovely Little Bumps\">Lovely Little Bumps</a> and also will drop papers for another quest.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
